                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5c6e2cd6-f481-4380-bd37-1318718c3ab7",
                                "sense_id": "bedf9af9-51da-332f-adb0-da0d61c9f3a8",
                                "text": "And many Authours doe in this manner wound the protection of their cause, by over-rashly running against that which they take hold-of, thirling [translating lanceant] such darts at their enemies, that might with much more advantage be cast at them."
